    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "dyn_desc",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 235,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "fn notify(item: &dyn Summary) { ... }\n\n- 运行期通过虚表(vtable)跳转\n- 必须用指针（&dyn / Box<dyn>）\n- 灵活：可存不同类型，有一点开销\n\n（trait 对象）",
      "originalText": "fn notify(item: &dyn Summary) { ... }\n\n- 运行期通过虚表(vtable)跳转\n- 必须用指针（&dyn / Box<dyn>）\n- 灵活：可存不同类型，有一点开销\n\n（trait 对象）",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#9a3412",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
